WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.314
The pallet transfer and dock scanner move the
packed lot to dispatch.

00:00:04.384 --> 00:00:09.284
A correct destination is useful only when the
pallet identity also matches.

00:00:09.494 --> 00:00:15.462
Connect pallet ID scan valid to DI10 and dock
transfer release to DO10.

00:00:15.532 --> 00:00:18.649
The scan is evidence, and the release is a
command.

00:00:18.859 --> 00:00:21.351
Set the dock lane assignment to lane 2.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:25.944
Match the packed lot, production order and
selected lane before transfer.

00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:28.669
Inject an unreadable pallet identity.

00:00:28.739 --> 00:00:33.947
Keep the load in staging and inspect the
outstanding order rather than issuing another
transfer.

00:00:34.157 --> 00:00:37.426
Rescan the matching pallet and confirm the dock
lane.

00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:44.055
The worked batch dispatches all 744 packed
kilograms without an extra process loss.
